---
description: Security and secrets handling
globs:
  - "**/*.ts"
alwaysApply: true
---

- Secrets
  - Never commit secrets. Read from environment or runtime secret managers.
  - Do not log secrets or tokens. Redact sensitive values in logs and errors.

- Input safety
  - Validate and sanitize external inputs. Enforce size limits on bodies/streams.
  - Escape or reject suspicious content in prompts where needed.

- Transport and storage
  - Use HTTPS endpoints; verify certificates when customizing fetch/clients.
  - Store only necessary data; prefer short-lived in-memory caches over disk.

